"ws-header wst-header-structure wst-unknown wst-header ws-header ws-noexport noprint dynlayout-exempt\"><div class=\"wst-header-mainblock wst-unknown-mainblock headertemplate\"><div class=\"wst-header-back searchaux wst-unknown-back\"><div class=\"wst-header-back-arrow\">←</div><div class=\"wst-header-back-link\"><a href=\"/wiki/Consider_the_Consequences!/H-31\" title=\"Consider the Consequences!/H-31\">H-31</a></div></div><div class=\"wst-header-central-cell wst-unknown-central-cell\"><span class=\"wst-header-title wst-unknown-title\"><span class=\"wst-header-title-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Consider_the_Consequences!\" title=\"Consider the Consequences!\">Consider the Consequences!</a></span><div class=\"header-section-text\">H-32</div></span></div><div class=\"wst-header-forward searchaux wst-unknown-forward\"><div class=\"wst-header-forward-link\"><a href=\"/wiki/Consider_the_Consequences!/H-33\" title=\"Consider the Consequences!/H-33\">H-33</a></div><div class=\"wst-header-forward-arrow\">→</div></div></div><div class=\"ws-noexport\" id=\"ws-data\" style=\"speak:none\"><span id=\"ws-article-id\">5009281</span><span id=\"ws-title\"><a href=\"/wiki/Consider_the_Consequences!\" title=\"Consider the Consequences!\">Consider the Consequences!</a> — H-32</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"prp-pages-output\" lang=\"en\">\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r15621227/mw-parser-output/.prp-pages-output\">.mw-parser-output .prp-pages-output .__pagefooter{font-size:smaller}</style><span><span class=\"pagenum ws-pagenum\" id=\"57\" data-page-number=\"57\" data-page-name=\"Page:Consider the Consequences! (IA consider-the-consequences-1930).djvu/62\" data-page-index=\"62\" data-page-quality=\"4\" title=\"Page:Consider&#95;the&#95;Consequences!&#95;(IA&#95;consider-the-consequences-1930).djvu/62\"><span id=\"pageindex&#95;62\" class=\"pagenum-inner ws-noexport\">&#8203;</span></span></span><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r15620827\">.mw-parser-output .wst-center{text-align:center;margin:0 auto}.mw-parser-output .wst-center.wst-center-nomargin>p{margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0}</style><div class=\"wst-center tiInherit\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:120%;\">H-32</span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wst-dhr\" style=\"visibility:hidden; line-height:100%;\">&#160;</div>\n<p><span class=\"smallcaps\" style=\"font-variant:small-caps;\">Saunders's</span> unfaithfulness was an unendurable shock to Helen's ego. When she sued for divorce she longed to refuse alimony, but the welfare of her boy forced her to accept it.\n</p><p>Now at last Helen was independent. She had her child, her freedom, and an income, but she had lost what she called illusions and some people call ideals. Since life had given her so little happiness, she searched restlessly for distraction. She moved from one social resort to another, substituting a touch-and-go life of gaiety for the home life she had missed. She kept her son always with her, staying near a school in winter and traveling in summer.\n</p><p>In this shifting life she met and married a tremendously wealthy man, and into the splendid life which opened out before her carried the discontent which had by this time become habitual. Her son's inheritance of his grandmother's estate brought into the family a large amount of money which was no longer needed.\n</p><p>The consequences of Helen's marrying Saunders for money, giving him no return in &#32;<span><span class=\"pagenum ws-pagenum\" id=\"58\" data-page-number=\"58\" data-page-name=\"Page:Consider the Consequences! (IA consider-the-consequences-1930).djvu/63\" data-page-index=\"63\" data-page-quality=\"4\" title=\"Page:Consider&#95;the&#95;Consequences!&#95;(IA&#95;consider-the-consequences-1930).djvu/63\"><span id=\"pageindex&#95;63\" class=\"pagenum-inner ws-noexport\">&#8203;</span></span></span>gratitude and affection, was that she finally had the material benefits so important to her, and lacked the love and generosity which did not much interest her.\n</p>\n<div class=\"&#95;&#95;nop wst-nop\"></div>\n<p>&#32;\n</p>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nParsed by mw‐api‐ext.eqiad.main‐77f8cc8f9b‐dk5gf\nCached time: 20260920184833\nCache expiry: 2592000\nCache expiry source: Module:Header (os.date(%Y))\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐page‐id, vary‐revision‐sha1]\nCPU time usage: 0.073 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.133 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 220/1000000\nRevision size: 273/2097152 bytes\nPost‐expand include size: 5520/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1062/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 11/100\nExpensive parser function count: 1/500\nUnstrip recursion depth: 1/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4796/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.034/10.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1032556/52428800 bytes\nNumber of Wikibase entities loaded: 0/500\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  126.057      1 -total\n 55.66%   70.161      1 Template:Header\n 22.38%   28.214      1 Page:Consider_the_Consequences!_(IA_consider-the-consequences-1930).djvu/62\n 15.43%   19.450      1 Template:C\n  7.68%    9.686      1 Template:Center/s\n  3.81%    4.798      2 Template:Optional_style\n  3.77%    4.756      1 Page:Consider_the_Consequences!_(IA_consider-the-consequences-1930).djvu/63\n  3.05%    3.842      1 Template:Larger\n  2.78%    3.503      2 MediaWiki:Proofreadpage_pagenum_template\n  2.56%    3.222      1 Template:Center/e\n-->\n\n<!-- Render ID e1162035-b523-11f1-8d66-67c26053c74c -->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key enwikisource:pcache:5009281:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20260920184833 and revision id 15622613. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"
